{"id":"3eb5325f08c84582","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-symbols.md","title":"Symbol Table","display":"df-symbols — Symbol Table","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-symbols","aliases":["17-df-symbols","17-symbols"],"display":"df-symbols — Symbol Table","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]","[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]"],"source_section":"1.2; 1.3","source_pages_print":[6,23],"source_pages_djvu":[22,39],"source_verification":"statement-compared; primitive-connective translation","label_origin":"local-catalog","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-symbols"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-symbols</span><span>17-symbols</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-symbols — Symbol Table"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.2; 1.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>6</span><span>23</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>22</span><span>39</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; primitive-connective translation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-symbols-—-Symbol-Table-ZFC-and-Model-Theory-Notation\">df-symbols — Symbol Table [ZFC and Model Theory Notation]</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AndTag},\\mathsf{OrTag},\\mathsf{IffTag},\\mathsf{ExistsTag}\">\\(\\mathsf{AndTag},\\mathsf{OrTag},\\mathsf{IffTag},\\mathsf{ExistsTag}\\)</span> 是下式定义的记号表标签，不是新增的原始语法构造；派生公式仍按本条的展开式生成。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(u\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。下列有限合取、析取和量词块函数按有限序列长度递归；对象语言的空合取/空析取分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_L,\\bot_L\">\\(\\top_L,\\bot_L\\)</span>。集合论量词中的有限合取仍属于元语言逻辑。单字提升及字符串构造见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A, B \\in \\mathrm{Set}\">\\(A, B \\in \\mathrm{Set}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z \\in \\mathrm{Set}\">\\(z \\in \\mathrm{Set}\\)</span> (set-theoretic variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogConn},\\mathrm{Quant},\\mathrm{RelSym}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogConn},\\mathrm{Quant},\\mathrm{RelSym}\\)</span> 是此处引入的记号表；对象语言连接词与元语言逻辑按所在层次区分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{AndTag}&amp;:=(1,7),\\qquad\\mathsf{OrTag}:=(1,8),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{IffTag}:=(1,9),\\qquad\\mathsf{ExistsTag}:=(1,10),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogConn} &amp;\\coloneqq \\{\\neg,\\mathsf{AndTag},\\mathsf{OrTag},\\to,\\mathsf{IffTag}\\}, \\\\\n\\mathrm{Quant} &amp;\\coloneqq \\{\\forall,\\mathsf{ExistsTag}\\}, \\\\\n\\mathrm{RelSym} &amp;\\coloneqq \\{{=}\\}, \\\\\nA \\subseteq B &amp;\\leftrightarrow \\forall z\\;(z \\in A \\to z \\in B), \\\\\nA \\subset B &amp;\\leftrightarrow (A \\subseteq B \\land A \\neq B), \\\\\nA = B &amp;\\leftrightarrow (A \\subseteq B \\land B \\subseteq A), \\\\\n(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\neg\\varphi\\to\\psi), \\\\\n(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi, \\\\\n(\\varphi \\land \\psi) &amp;\\coloneqq \\neg(\\varphi \\to \\neg\\psi), \\\\\n(\\varphi \\leftrightarrow \\psi) &amp;\\coloneqq ((\\varphi \\to \\psi) \\land (\\psi \\to \\varphi)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{AndTag}&amp;:=(1,7),\\qquad\\mathsf{OrTag}:=(1,8),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{IffTag}:=(1,9),\\qquad\\mathsf{ExistsTag}:=(1,10),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogConn} &amp;\\coloneqq \\{\\neg,\\mathsf{AndTag},\\mathsf{OrTag},\\to,\\mathsf{IffTag}\\}, \\\\\n\\mathrm{Quant} &amp;\\coloneqq \\{\\forall,\\mathsf{ExistsTag}\\}, \\\\\n\\mathrm{RelSym} &amp;\\coloneqq \\{{=}\\}, \\\\\nA \\subseteq B &amp;\\leftrightarrow \\forall z\\;(z \\in A \\to z \\in B), \\\\\nA \\subset B &amp;\\leftrightarrow (A \\subseteq B \\land A \\neq B), \\\\\nA = B &amp;\\leftrightarrow (A \\subseteq B \\land B \\subseteq A), \\\\\n(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\neg\\varphi\\to\\psi), \\\\\n(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi, \\\\\n(\\varphi \\land \\psi) &amp;\\coloneqq \\neg(\\varphi \\to \\neg\\psi), \\\\\n(\\varphi \\leftrightarrow \\psi) &amp;\\coloneqq ((\\varphi \\to \\psi) \\land (\\psi \\to \\varphi)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\top_L&amp;:=\\forall v_0\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)=\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)),\\qquad\\bot_L:=\\neg\\top_L,\\\\\n\\operatorname{And}_L(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;:=\\top_L,\\qquad\\operatorname{Or}_L(\\langle\\rangle):=\\bot_L,\\\\\n\\operatorname{And}_L(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)&amp;:=\\varphi,\\qquad\\operatorname{Or}_L(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle):=\\varphi,\\\\\n|s|&gt;0\\quad&amp;\\to\\quad\\operatorname{And}_L(s\\frown\\langle\\varphi\\rangle):=(\\operatorname{And}_L(s)\\land\\varphi),\\\\\n|s|&gt;0\\quad&amp;\\to\\quad\\operatorname{Or}_L(s\\frown\\langle\\varphi\\rangle):=(\\operatorname{Or}_L(s)\\lor\\varphi),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}\\varphi_i&amp;:=\\operatorname{And}_L(\\langle\\varphi_i:i&lt;n\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}\\varphi_i:=\\operatorname{Or}_L(\\langle\\varphi_i:i&lt;n\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{All}_L(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi)&amp;:=\\varphi,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi):=\\varphi,\\\\\n\\operatorname{All}_L(\\langle x\\rangle\\frown u,\\varphi)&amp;:=\\forall x\\,\\operatorname{All}_L(u,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle x\\rangle\\frown u,\\varphi)&amp;:=\\exists x\\,\\operatorname{Exists}_L(u,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\,\\varphi&amp;:=\\operatorname{All}_L(\\langle x_i:i&lt;n\\rangle,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\exists x_0\\cdots\\exists x_{n-1}\\,\\varphi&amp;:=\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle x_i:i&lt;n\\rangle,\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\top_L&amp;:=\\forall v_0\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)=\\operatorname{lit}(v_0)),\\qquad\\bot_L:=\\neg\\top_L,\\\\\n\\operatorname{And}_L(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;:=\\top_L,\\qquad\\operatorname{Or}_L(\\langle\\rangle):=\\bot_L,\\\\\n\\operatorname{And}_L(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)&amp;:=\\varphi,\\qquad\\operatorname{Or}_L(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle):=\\varphi,\\\\\n|s|&gt;0\\quad&amp;\\to\\quad\\operatorname{And}_L(s\\frown\\langle\\varphi\\rangle):=(\\operatorname{And}_L(s)\\land\\varphi),\\\\\n|s|&gt;0\\quad&amp;\\to\\quad\\operatorname{Or}_L(s\\frown\\langle\\varphi\\rangle):=(\\operatorname{Or}_L(s)\\lor\\varphi),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}\\varphi_i&amp;:=\\operatorname{And}_L(\\langle\\varphi_i:i&lt;n\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\bigvee_{i&lt;n}\\varphi_i:=\\operatorname{Or}_L(\\langle\\varphi_i:i&lt;n\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{All}_L(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi)&amp;:=\\varphi,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi):=\\varphi,\\\\\n\\operatorname{All}_L(\\langle x\\rangle\\frown u,\\varphi)&amp;:=\\forall x\\,\\operatorname{All}_L(u,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle x\\rangle\\frown u,\\varphi)&amp;:=\\exists x\\,\\operatorname{Exists}_L(u,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\,\\varphi&amp;:=\\operatorname{All}_L(\\langle x_i:i&lt;n\\rangle,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\exists x_0\\cdots\\exists x_{n-1}\\,\\varphi&amp;:=\\operatorname{Exists}_L(\\langle x_i:i&lt;n\\rangle,\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对象语言连接词是显式字符串缩写，元语言逻辑用于表达定义。集合接口直接取本册 17-df-set-functions；不依赖第 58 本文件。有限合取、析取及量词块的零长度情形已在 Assertion 中给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-symbols-—-Symbol-Table-ZFC-and-Model-Theory-Notation","text":"df-symbols — Symbol Table [ZFC and Model Theory Notation]","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"058f3c1c00535492","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-